{"name":"Chalet","hex":"#c29867","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"chalet","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An alpine style of wooden building with a sloping roof and overhanging eaves. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A recreational lodge or small house within the grounds of a resort or country club dedicated to the uniformed services, used for events, staycations and other social gatherings."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chalet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chalet","blocks":[{"text":"A chalet, also called Swiss chalet, is a type of building or house, typical of the Alpine region in Europe. It is made of wood, with a heavy, gently sloping roof and wide, well-supported eaves set at right angles to the front of the house."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Ormont-Dessus%2C_Vers-L%27Eglise%2C_route_de_Brison_2.jpg/330px-Ormont-Dessus%2C_Vers-L%27Eglise%2C_route_de_Brison_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chalet"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg/500px-DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg/1280px-DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg/500px-DirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A 'chalet' in the hills to the east of Orosí, Costa Rica","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADirkvdM_orosi_chalet.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/House_built_by_Ruth_Trummer_in_Hagere_Selam.jpg/500px-House_built_by_Ruth_Trummer_in_Hagere_Selam.jpg?utm